  "parameter_rationale": "Full integer delay scope 1–20 (approximately one trading month on 1D; increasingly shorter wall-clock periods below 1D), plus same-bar delay 0. Cross with both confirmation types, 0/100% prior-leg threshold and 0/50% pivot-wick threshold. All 164 combinations are declared before the full run; no sparse sampling of candle delays.",
  "min_bars": 100,
  "baseline": "25%-capital buy-and-hold on the same instrument/timeframe/costs; bend__close__d1__r0__w0 is the first-next-bar confirmation control.",
  "signal_rule": "On each completed bar compute BB20 SMA(close) +/- 2 population standard deviations. A one-sided band touch creates/replaces latest provisional high/low. At delay 0, the touching candle closes back inside its band with body away from the extreme. At each exact delay 1–20 since the last new extreme, close requires an opposite-direction body and close versus previous bar; break requires close beyond previous bar low/high. Optional filters: current leg >= preceding leg, pivot wick >=50% of pivot candle range. One signal per pivot. Long after low, short after high; fill at next bar open. Opposite qualifying entry reverses. No future pivot confirmation.",
  "signal_semantics": "Causal bend entry at completed candle close; future 3/10-bar returns and correlations are diagnostic outcomes only, never signal inputs.",
  "evaluation_unit": "Independent 1m RUB virtual account per symbol; this is not a combined portfolio.",
  "execution_timing": "Observe completed signal candle; fill next available candle open. No intrabar order or historical pivot-center fill.",
  "holding_period": "Until opposite qualifying signal; no fixed target in this entry-only comparison.",
  "rebalance_rule": "No intrabar rebalance; at most one position per account.",
